1
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:04,949
Every academic year, curriculum
decisions and student

2
00:00:04,989 --> 00:00:07,763
follow-up get spread
across separate tools.

3
00:00:08,223 --> 00:00:11,883
Which books? Who follows up?
And where are the grades?

4
00:00:13,933 --> 00:00:16,690
Curriculum Scope: one
platform that connects the

5
00:00:16,730 --> 00:00:19,383
curriculum, the classroom
and the institution.

6
00:00:21,433 --> 00:00:23,293
Three connected layers:

7
00:00:23,753 --> 00:00:26,179
an up-to-date catalogue
of Egypt’s curricula,

8
00:00:26,219 --> 00:00:28,403
where the school decides what it covers;

9
00:00:28,863 --> 00:00:31,877
classes, homework and tests built on it;

10
00:00:32,337 --> 00:00:36,167
and secure institutional
management, in Arabic and English.

11
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:41,497
It is built for private and
international schools and school groups,

12
00:00:41,537 --> 00:00:45,833
education technology companies and
publishers, and tutoring centres.

13
00:00:46,293 --> 00:00:48,790
Universities are a later expansion.

14
00:00:50,033 --> 00:00:53,853
A catalogue of twelve
grades, 231 subjects and

15
00:00:53,893 --> 00:00:57,417
more than a thousand books and references.

16
00:00:57,877 --> 00:01:00,605
The team picks the books
for each grade and track,

17
00:01:00,645 --> 00:01:03,027
and the decision is
kept as a shared scope,

18
00:01:03,487 --> 00:01:08,120
exported, compared, and carried
to the next year in one step.

19
00:01:08,967 --> 00:01:12,017
Every book has an owner,
a due date and a reminder,

20
00:01:12,057 --> 00:01:14,403
so nothing gets lost between messages.

21
00:01:18,900 --> 00:01:22,497
The teacher sets homework
linked to the curriculum,

22
00:01:22,957 --> 00:01:25,620
then marks it and
returns it with comments.

23
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:34,122
Online tests run on time kept by
the server, with live monitoring

24
00:01:34,162 --> 00:01:38,050
and automatic marking — the
final say stays with the teacher.

25
00:01:38,510 --> 00:01:41,203
Then the marks come
together in one gradebook.

26
00:01:42,033 --> 00:01:47,250
Students find their school day on
their phone: homework and tests,

27
00:01:47,710 --> 00:01:51,177
their grades and their books, with
an account their school manages.

28
00:01:52,900 --> 00:01:57,350
Teachers get lighter manual
follow-up, students find everything

29
00:01:57,390 --> 00:02:01,450
in one place, and the institution
sees the whole picture.

30
00:02:02,900 --> 00:02:06,748
Each institution’s data is
isolated inside the database,

31
00:02:06,788 --> 00:02:10,323
with roles, two-step
verification and an audit log,

32
00:02:10,783 --> 00:02:15,060
and the platform team sees a school’s
work only with its permission.

33
00:02:16,300 --> 00:02:21,117
The intelligent educational assistant
is a future vision, not built yet;

34
00:02:21,577 --> 00:02:26,723
it will work under clear rules: it never
changes a grade, and the teacher decides.

35
00:02:27,967 --> 00:02:31,144
The platform is functionally
complete and tested locally,

36
00:02:31,184 --> 00:02:34,463
and is getting ready for a
pilot with partner institutions.

37
00:02:35,700 --> 00:02:41,167
We invite schools and education and
publishing companies to the pilot programme.

38
00:02:41,627 --> 00:02:44,863
Curriculum Scope: a clear
curriculum, a connected classroom,

39
00:02:44,903 --> 00:02:47,493
and an institution that
sees the whole picture.

40
00:02:47,953 --> 00:02:50,230
Contact us for a live demo.
